eturns the character encoding of the input stream.Returns a single line from the input stream and returns a string. Since this is working off of a stream, it is not subject to the 5MB size limit.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/c\\_GlideTextReaderScopedAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":1,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[60,67]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideTextReaderScopedAPI.md"},
